  "question": "Suppose $x$ is an irrational number and $a,b,c,d$ are non-zero rational numbers. If $\\frac{ax+b}{cx+d}$ is rational, then we must have",
  "options": {
    "A": "$a=c=0$;",
    "B": "$a=c,b=d$;",
    "C": "$ad=bc$;",
    "D": "$a+d=b+c$"
